  "result": "Perfect! All 50 tests pass. I've successfully added:\n\n\u2705 **`addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })`** \u2014 adds a line to a draft invoice:\n- Adds new line at the end if SKU doesn't exist\n- Increases qty if SKU already exists (no duplicates)\n- Validates qty (positive integer) and SKU like `createInvoice`\n- Returns NOT_DRAFT if invoice status isn't 'draft'\n- Never mutates original invoice\n\n\u2705 **`removeLine(invoice, sku)`** \u2014 removes a line from a draft invoice:\n- Removes the line with the given SKU\n- Returns LINE_NOT_FOUND if SKU not on invoice\n- Returns NO_LINES if it would leave the invoice empty\n- Returns NOT_DRAFT if invoice status isn't 'draft'\n- Never mutates original invoice\n\n\u2705 **Updated `src/errors.js`** with two new error codes: NOT_DRAFT, LINE_NOT_FOUND\n\n\u2705 **13 new tests** covering all cases including chaining operations together",
